    "metaDescription": "Discover the best time to visit Morocco based on weather and top destinations. Detailed analysis of the four seasons to plan your trip.",
    "focusKeyword": "best time to visit Morocco",
    "excerpt": "Wondering when to book your trip to Morocco? Learn about the weather conditions and optimal seasons for each destination in this guide.",
    "category": "Travel Tips",
