    "metaDescription": "Explore Morocco's gorgeous blue-washed city. Detailed guide to Chefchaouen's medina, best hotels, photo spots, and Rif hiking trails.",
    "focusKeyword": "Chefchaouen travel guide",
    "excerpt": "Located in northern Morocco, Chefchaouen is famous for its quiet atmosphere and iconic blue walls. Read our ultimate travel guide.",
    "category": "Destination Guide",
