    "metaTitle": "Things to Do in Marrakech | Ultimate Sightseeing Guide 2026",
    "metaDescription": "Discover the best landmarks in Marrakech. Complete guide to Jemaa el-Fnaa, Bahia Palace, Majorelle Garden, and Medina shopping tips.",
    "focusKeyword": "Things to do in Marrakech",
