    "title": "Discovering Fes Medina: Historical and Cultural Guide",
    "metaTitle": "Fes Medina Travel Guide | University & Leather Tanneries 2026",
    "metaDescription": "Explore Fes el Bali, the world's largest car-free city. Detailed guide to Al-Qarawiyyin University, Chouara tanneries, and historic madrasas.",
    "focusKeyword": "Fes Medina travel",
    "excerpt": "Step back in time inside Fes el Bali. Discover the oldest active university, traditional leather tanneries, and artisan souks.",
    "category": "Heritage",
