    "content": "\n<p>Tangier has long been an inspiration for writers and artists, situated on the Strait of Gibraltar where the Mediterranean Sea meets the Atlantic Ocean.</p>\n\n<h2>Top Attractions to Visit in Tangier</h2>\n<p>Discover the historic medina, Spanish-influenced avenues, and dramatic coastal views.</p>\n\n<blockquote class=\"custom-blockquote\">\n\"Tangier was an international zone between 1923 and 1956, attracting writers, artists, and diplomats from across the globe.\"\n</blockquote>\n\n<table class=\"html-table\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Landmark</th>\n      <th>Highlights</th>\n      <th>Optimal Time to Visit</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Hercules Caves</td>\n      <td>Natural caves with an opening shaped like the map of Africa</td>\n      <td>Late afternoon</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Kasbah District</td>\n      <td>Historical high point, ancient palaces, and museum</td>\n      <td>Morning</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Cape Spartel</td>\n      <td>Scenic lighthouse marking the border of the Atlantic and Mediterranean</td>\n      <td>Sunset</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Explore customized northern tours starting in Tangier and visiting Chefchaouen and Fes at <a href=\"/morocco-tours?city=Tangier\">Tangier tour packages</a>.</p>\n",
